>I'm having trouble with colour on my IBM. [paraphrase]

  I have helped three people with this problem, so I suppose I should post
  my suggestions. ;)

  First, make sure you have ANSI.SYS installed -- the vanilla one that comes
  with DOS.  The reason:  I know it works.  Other ANSI's might work, but
  I haven't used them (NANSI, VANSI, etc...).

  Second, *don't* set the TERMCAP environment variable.

  Third, make sure you have the nethack options: IBMgraphics, rawio, and BIOS.
  (Any, and perhaps all, of the above three options may not be necessary.
  The TERMCAP bit higher up, it seems, is.)

  Enjoy, and remember how much you payed for this if it doesn't work... :)
